<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1043] Blocked in inaccessible notebook with blank page</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1043</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, when a user who doesn&apos;t have a permission for a notebook is trying to access to the notebook, a dialog is shown up. The user can login in this dialog or close it.&lt;br/&gt;
But if the user is trying to just close this dialog, the location is not changed and still stay `/notebook/NOTE_ID` with blank page. So the user have to click somewhere manually. In this case, Zeppelin should go to the previous page. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
